    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmo iri ya/abín, bariise sleémeero ar Yuda nee ar Yerusalemu inós kuri i burumburiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo iri tsa/án amór Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ dinkwa nee múk Yuda sleémeero, nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu sleémeero, dinkwa nee kaahamuusér Mungú nee aaruuseero, nee muu sleémeero oo ninákw nee oo urene, axweesanoó kitaábuú alqado sleémeero guri dir'ín i soomuús, kudá' taa sláy baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo iri sihhiít dír bihhaá uhmo, al'axweesani gari qaás dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa eehari, nee hara'ayaarós ngiwa oohi, nee lamabu'uungós nee kaahirose ar muunaáwós sleémeero nee ar qeeruuwós sleémeero. /Ayma'aá taa gooín baraá kitaábuuduú alqado ngiwa eehari. Muu sleémeero al'axweesantadá' gari ya/án.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Yosia kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú Hilkia, nee kaahamuusér hatlá' ar inós gu alee/imiis, nee xuumuusér afér maraay gina ádbáy xooslaadá' taa tleéhh as Ba'ali nee Ashera nee as tsatse/uuduú gawaá doori kuwa sluufmiisi, kingiwa duuxi baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, nee kawa da/i tsee/aá Yerusalemu baraá xatstá Kidroni, nee da/araarós kari huuw ay Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kaahamuusér murslaaqat gana hingeés, tidá' aáng waawituú Yuda aa qaás as mooyángw tsuú' kuwa da/aa/an gawaá kiteeridaá gawaá gongoama', kudá' baraá gixsadaá Yuda nee awa baraá yaamaá Yerusalemu sleémeerowo, kudá' sleeme mooyaangw ngwa da/aa/ane' dír Ba'ali, nee tsee/amá, nee slahhaangw, nee tsatse/uú urén, nee tsatse/ sleémeero kuduú gawaá doori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós Ashera gana hingeés baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa alé, gari kwaáhh tsee/aá Yerusalemu ay Kidroni, gari daá/ baraá xatstá Kidroni, gari naasúy, giri adór teeri tleéhh, teeridá' gari kwaáhh gawaá /aantá muu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós maraá mukduú tsaatu'uumár tlehhiít baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale gina feé/, nee didá' /ameena hiya'aá sluufmisuú Ashera ngiwa tlehhit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kaahamuuse sleémeero gari tsee/aá gixsadaá Yuda i duúx, nee kiteeridaá gawaá gongoama' giri meetagaás, kudá' kaahamuuse i mooyángw tsuú' i da/a/aan, iimír Gebár wa tleemu ay Be'er-sheba. Inós didár gongoamo ar ilahhooa gari feé/ didár dahmaá afkú Yeshua ga/aawusmoó gixsa, didár bihhaá doó basáy awa afkú gixsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kaahamuuse tidár amór kiteeridá' gawa na tsa/ani'iiká amór kitangwduú baraá Yerusalemu, kuduú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ala inooín mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká ngina /ayiyé' baraá tla/ángw hhaeeín wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yosia Tofeti gari meeta gaás, tidár baraá xatstá daaqoó Hinomu, as hee garmaawós laqaá dasiirós mingiwa baraá xátstí daá/ tawa ilahhooár munguú ta bay Moloki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farasuudá' aáng waawituú Yuda aa duxún dír tsee/amá, kudá' sihhiit didár dahmaá amór doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ dír inslaawoó doó Natan-meleki, heedaádá' taa karmúy. Waawutmo Yosia farsuudá' guna hingeés nee gaardaá tsee/amá giri ásltí qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiteeridaá waawituú Yuda aa tleéhh gawaá kitaarár kutuwír Ahasi, dinkwa nee kiteeridaá ilahhooa Manase aa tleéhh baraá afeenadá' tsár ar guruú doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, gina fe/iít nee giri naasúy, teeridá' gari kwaáhh baraá xatstá Kidroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo kiteeridá' gawaá gongoama' awa bihhaá da/aáw Yerusalemuro gina meeta gaás, nee bihhidaá tloomár hhituru'uuma didá' Solomon waawutmoó Israeli aa tleéhh as Ashtaroti, tidá' ta waki ar múk Sidoni, nee Kemosi ar múk Moabu, nee Milkomu ar múk Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheemi gina giqáy, murslaaqatuú Ashera guri tlaáq, nee didá' ni sihhitiyé' gari fadaá múkwí dalaá/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe kitangwduú ilahhooa, kuduú Beteli oo gawaá gongoamo oo Yeroboamu garmoó Nebati, kudá' múk Israeli gwaa baraá tlakweemií dahaas, aa tleéhh, guna feé/, wa/eeridaá ilahhooa awa gawaá gongoam' gana feé/, tlaa/eewós giri naasúy adór teeri, slaqsa'aá Ashera giri daá/ ar asla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Yosia iwa warqáy /aantu gina ár gawaá tlooma, iri ya/abín faduudaá baraadá' kiwa duuxi. Faduudá' kiri duúx, giri daá/ gawaá kiteeridá' ta ilahhooárií hanmaamisi. Kiteeridá' giri meeta gaás ar adoodá' heedaáduú Mungú ngira axweés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo iri oó', «Garqár dirqá' ar milá?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk gixsadá' tari oó', «A /aantár heé Mungú, kuduú Yuda, kudá' tí kuúng ta tlehhit gawaá kitángw ilahhooa oo Beteli nga geerií aarin.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iri oó', «/Aantarós ma kwatiitara'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín kari máy, dinkwa nee /aantár aarusmoduú yaamaá Samariár daáhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maraá ilahhooa sleeme kudá' taa tleéhh nee waawituú Israeli amór gawa baraá gixsár Samariaro. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kway buhhtís, Yosia gina feé/ ar adoodá' aa tleéhh dír kitangwduú baraá Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér dír kiteeridá' gawaá gongoama' wa gadiyuus gana tsuú/, nee gawaá kiteeridae fadaá muu giri gawaadií daá/, nee inós iri waátl Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo muu guri báy, «Deelór Pasaáka ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng na amohhe'eemisaak adoodá' kara gooín baraá kitaábuuwí oo alqadoro.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór adór tí ga aw kaa baloó tleehhiiká iimír har'ohuuser múk Israeliro, laqaá de'emaá waawituú Israeliro laqaá de'emaá waawituú Yudawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala deeloorí ur ar Pasaáka taa tleéhh dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ baraá Yerusalemúr wa ale, kawa tleéhh a kurkú mibaá nee dakaát oo waawuti'iimár Yosia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yosia qwaslaarér giaá duxuum nee da/aluuse, nee murslaaqat nee slaqsi'i dinkwa nee muruudá' ló'wa buhhtamís, sleémeero guna hingeés baraá yaamaá Yudawo as tidá' taa gooín baraá kitaábuudá' Hilkia kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú aa sláy baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraá waawutmo Yosiawo, laqaá tam aluuwose, waawutmoó adór inós i kaahh oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gwa eehaar ar muunaáwós sleémeero, nee ar /uuruuwós sleémeero, nee qeeruuwós sleémeero, adoodá' kara gooín baraá dabér Mosewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
